---
Checks the project with the leptoskit rules and clippy, side by side.

The rules follow the `[lint]` table of `leptoskit.toml`: components carry `#[component]`, and component trees are written the way `markup` says.

Usage: leptoskit lint [OPTIONS] [PATHS]... [-- <CLIPPY_ARGS>...]

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...
          Files or directories for the leptoskit rules; the whole project by default. clippy checks the workspace, excluding host crates whose platforms are not listed in `app.platforms`

  [CLIPPY_ARGS]...
          Arguments passed on to clippy, such as `-- -W clippy::nursery`

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>
          Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml

      --no-clippy
          Run only the leptoskit rules

      --deny-warnings
          Fail on warnings as well as errors

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
